      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.theroute-66.com/lupton.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Before settlers, the Anasazi people farmed the region, reaching their peak between 700 and 1150 A.D. before moving south.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
